{"data": [{"id": "2122027072990405037", "author_id": "1212651734209724416", "text": "@shao__meng frontend-design 好在视觉上强，但代码维护起来会不会比普通组件库重很多？", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:00:54.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/bookingX0/status/2122027072990405037", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121950034375872953", "author_id": "1876511629741060096", "text": "@shao__meng 感谢分享，先 mark 了", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:54:46.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/aiwaremax/status/2121950034375872953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121939929119002724", "author_id": "1505399093803159559", "text": "@shao__meng 5 月那版 1.3k 收藏，半年后还得更新，清单也会过期。我存过一堆没用就废了，这次先拿一个用在动画页上。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:14:37.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/yanjingshen1/status/2121939929119002724", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121936021718012086", "author_id": "1390955686142517249", "text": "@shao__meng 技能列表更新得及时，不过装之前还是要看看来源和权限。选一个当前项目真用得上的，先在小范围试试。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T11:59:05.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/KevinWeb3Nomad/status/2121936021718012086", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121916906966012040", "author_id": "787390607450894340", "text": "@shao__meng shadcn那条新入榜，必须mark。", "lang": "ja", "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:43:08.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/du6liu/status/2121916906966012040", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121903623156433160", "author_id": "1825556649723240448", "text": "@shao__meng react-best-practices都70条了，我装的还是老版，得抽空换掉。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:50:21.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/JMkernt/status/2121903623156433160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121901175633240112", "author_id": "251518654", "text": "@shao__meng 这事最有用的其实是你半年就得重列一遍。skills保鲜期真短，我现在都不敢整包扔进项目，尤其frontend-design，换个模型口味全变，页面还容易做成同一套AI味。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:40:37.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/zshjzls/status/2121901175633240112", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121899958966362393", "author_id": "1442361250285953027", "text": "@shao__meng 清单放半年，OpenAI那个 frontend-skill 四月就下了，旧的不更新，装进去就是空的。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:35:47.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/MaoHeShui_Web3/status/2121899958966362393", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121894142284632091", "author_id": "1769777068462735364", "text": "@shao__meng 这份更新版最值钱的是“失效提醒”：Skills 这东西半年就能过期一半，名字一改、仓库一废弃，照抄旧清单直接踩坑。我自己给企业做落地时也是这个思路——不贪多，先把 figma-design-to-code + shadcn 这条设计稿到代码的链路跑通，再用 webapp-testing 兜底验证，链路比单点清单重要。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:12:41.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Lazy30512488561/status/2121894142284632091", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1212651734209724416", "username": "bookingX0", "name": "0xSean", "verified": false}, {"id": "1727548535816724480", "username": "shao__meng", "name": "meng shao", "verified": false}, {"id": "1876511629741060096", "username": "aiwaremax", "name": "AIWare", "verified": false}, {"id": "1505399093803159559", "username": "yanjingshen1", "na